  "contract": [
    "Fortuitous (561328) promises instant Glare above 80% health. Its helper (561396) lasts 1500 ms in the DBC.",
    "The custom health gate disables the native 1000 ms periodic refresh and owns helper application/removal.",
    "At stable 95% health for 20 seconds, the helper must remain active without being cast again.",
    "The previous helper expired and Refresh recreated it every 1500 ms, causing aura removal/reapplication.",
    "A fall to 70% removes it; a rise to 85% grants it once. Unlearning the talent removes it again.",
    "Glare cast time and normal damaging casts verify that the continuously active helper still grants its effect.",
    "The reported level 45 is used; regeneration is disabled to keep the health condition independent of time."
  ],
